### 在新的空持久化目录中启动服务后运行；HTTP 默认 8080。
### 同键同参数再次提交会返回原订单，不产生第二笔成交。
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-buyer",
  "clientOrderId": "buy-001",
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
  "side": "BUY",
  "price": 10000,
  "quantity": 5
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-seller",
  "clientOrderId": "sell-001",
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
  "side": "SELL",
  "price": 10000,
  "quantity": 3
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/book?symbol=BTCUSDT

### 带斜杠的交易对使用查询参数，不将 %2F 放入路径。
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/book?symbol=BTC%2FUSDT

### 将下单响应的 data.finalOrder.orderId 填入下方 orderId，撤销剩余数量。
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
  "orderId": "<replace-with-buy-order-id>"
}
